WEBVTT

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:10.930
I'd no idea there was a
bathhouse this close to campus!

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.220
Ain't it great?

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.720
Yeah, it's so refreshing.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.640
Nuthin' beats a good soak after workin' up a sweat during practice!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.410
Electric Bath

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.770
What a shame that it's men only tho-tho-tho--

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.100
Huh? We're missin' someone.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.270
Oh yeah, what's-his-face.

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:33.020
Y'know, the guy named after a season!

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.720
Aki!

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.390
Akiii!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.600
Not autumn, you idiot!

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.850
I know that already!

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:43.310
Fuyuo! Fuyuooo!

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:45.180
Not winter. Close but no cigar!

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:46.560
Natsuhiko!

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.890
Summer? Stop beating a dead horse!

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:56.180
What is wrong with this team?

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:19.470
<i>I'll put an end to spending</i>
<i>my days so thoughtlessly</i>

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:23.520
<i>I'm dying to break free of this</i>

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.220
<i>Since I can never take that first step forward,</i>

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:33.310
<i>you always take my hand and pull me along</i>

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:39.140
<i>You've brought me to see</i>
<i>something completely new</i>

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.430
<i>My whole world is changing</i>

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.640
<i>With that first step</i>

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.850
<i>I felt transformed</i>

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:52.810
<i>I can go anywhere; it'll work</i>
<i>out so long as we're together</i>

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:54.390
<i>Go on, fly high, </i>

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:56.020
<i>just as you are</i>

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.180
<i>At times you'll feel lost and scared,</i>

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:05.680
<i>but there are so many things you</i>
<i>won't know if you never give them a go</i>

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.310
<i>Go on, fly high, </i>

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:12.180
<i>stretch out your hands until</i>
<i>you're almost touching the sky</i>

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.430
<i>We're not alone anymore</i>

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:20.560
<i>Together we'll fly into a new world</i>

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.520
Haru, pass me the 7 spice blend.

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:41.850
What's up? Why the cold shoulder?

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:45.180
'Cuz you were makin' fun of him. Right?

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.270
I, um...

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:50.520
What, are you shy or sumthin'?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.060
That's right!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.770
From now on, if something comes up...

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.390
...mention it here.

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:59.560
Like stuff you don't get
or what you practiced.

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:00.810
What you practiced?

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:01.970
Yup!

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:06.640
Like I said before, you should be doing
stretches and handstands every day.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.140
A message group?

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.430
What are you so excited about?

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:15.060
You're creeping me out.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:18.180
I have opened yet another new door.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.270
You've never done this before?!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.060
Now there's six of us.

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:26.270
We just need one more person.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.180
One more?

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:34.470
Now that ya mention it,
we know the perfect guy!

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.890
He's quite a handsome young man.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.560
His name's Sho Tokugawa.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.430
We're in the same gym class.

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:57.470
So that's why you told us
to wear gym clothes.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.560
He's got a good, athletic build.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:08.600
Oh dear! Kazu, darling, my eyes are up here!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.470
Just kiddin'!

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.220
So you're taking gym, too!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.390
I, um...

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.220
Yeah.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.100
Say, are you okay?

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.850
Oh, yeah!

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:58.970
I just crashed into the mat
earlier and got a bloody nose.

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:04.180
Hey...

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:06.850
Thanks for caring.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:08.020
See ya!

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.140
The next guy! That's him!

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:17.470
He's got a nice round-off.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.680
His back handspring is solid.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.680
And his backflip is really high!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.890
Impressive.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.600
We've found our seventh member!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.350
Men's Locker Room

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:39.680
Here he is!

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:40.720
Tokugawaaa!

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:43.020
Sho Tokugawaaa!

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.890
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.060
That's Risujiro, isn't it?

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:00.680
Risujiro?

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:02.850
Isn't he one of those advertising mascots?

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:06.180
Well, I quite like him.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.020
So...?

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:09.350
Sorry! Here's what we came for.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:14.220
We'd like you to join our Cheerleading Club.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:20.390
We secretly snuck into your class today
to find more members for our team.

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:23.350
It was love at first sight.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:28.350
We were all so impressed by your tumbling!

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.600
A Men's Cheerleading Club?

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:34.720
I'm pretty sure we have one for women...

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.350
But yours is different from that, right?

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.850
We started up just recently.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.350
I can't join you.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.970
We need your skills, Sho!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:53.770
Sho?

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:55.520
He's already on a first-name basis.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.720
Why can't you join?

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:02.310
I saw your demonstration the other day.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:07.140
It consisted of mostly simple motions,
as well as handstands and shoulder sits.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:12.560
The only thing that resembled tumbling
was these guy's handsprings.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:16.140
And they didn't even do them that well.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:21.390
There's no way you can do cheerleading
like that, let alone with an all-men's team.

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:23.930
I've never seen such a team.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:29.390
A bunch of amateurs all practicing
together will just hurt themselves.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:35.520
And tumbling's not your only problem.
How do you plan to practice stunts and dancing?

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:40.850
I don't want to be on such
a naive cheerleading team.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:47.350
We're far from naive.

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:49.180
We're 100% serious!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.890
We'll prove it to you...

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:55.720
...in gym class one week from today!

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:07.140
Say, how do you plan on convincin' him?

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:09.390
I'm still figuring that out.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:13.350
You just said that off
the top of your head?!

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:17.850
But didn't he seem pretty
familiar with cheerleading?

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.140
Oh, yeah! So what're stunts, anyway?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.930
The kinds of moves you see
in group gymnastics.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.060
You can't do cheerleading without them.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.600
You sure know a lot about it.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:31.310
Well, I did a little research.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:33.140
Right!

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:37.470
Mizoguchi's got a point. We need
to show Sho that we mean it.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:40.020
He understands the rigors of cheerleading.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:43.310
And he at least has
some experience with it.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:48.470
If we prove that we're serious,
then we'll surely change his mind.

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:50.180
What's your plan?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:54.220
We're going to learn how to do
a round-off back handspring.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:59.560
A round-off? You mean that
thing he did in gym class?

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:04.180
Yup. We'll perform it
for him a week from now.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:09.350
That will convince him that
we're serious about this.

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:12.350
And then we'll ask him again!

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.770
Right, I'll demonstrate it first.

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:26.310
That was great!

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:29.220
I've been practicing every morning and evening.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.770
In addition to our group practice?

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.350
I told you I was going to do cheerleading.

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:37.310
It would be pretty sad
if I couldn't do one.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:41.810
Right! Here's my round-off!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:48.560
If you don't land with both feet on
the ground, then it's just a cartwheel.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:52.060
In a round-off you turn your body
sideways in one smooth motion.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:56.640
Then you land with your feet together.

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:57.970
Got it!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.680
You two are in good shape.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:03.060
Okay, Mizoguchi, give it a try!

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.270
Right!

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:10.600
Now, Ton!

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:13.810
Haru!

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:21.470
The three of you can already do a handstand.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:26.470
So now you just need to get the hang of it
and flip over with all your might!

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:28.850
Make sure to keep your knees straight!

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.180
Eyes on the gap between your hands!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:35.430
Act like you're kicking
the ceiling with your toes!

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.430
I just can't do it right...

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:41.220
Can we really master this in a week?

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:46.600
Oh?

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:48.270
From morning 'til night
I go nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.890
In the ocean and in the mountains
I go nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:51.640
Whenever and wherever
I go nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:54.720
Together we all go nuts, nuts,
nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.140
So sour!

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:58.600
But so good!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.550
Crunchy
Pickled
Plums

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:04.220
Risujiro is simply adorable!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.850
Nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts...

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:09.270
Risujiro the second of four siblings.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:15.720
The others are Risutaro,
Risusaburo, and Risushiro.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:16.930
Here they are.

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:19.970
Oh, so you have a full set.

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:21.520
I'd never noticed.

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:23.770
Squirrels are pretty nimble.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:26.890
If only I was more like a squirrel...

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:31.390
Doing a round-off with
a back handspring is just...

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.140
I can't do it either.

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:35.560
I always did track and field.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:39.100
I'm good at running, but not at doing flips.

