each other for a long time.

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:06.720
I played baseball with Ichiro back
in elementary and middle school.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.970
He became a first-string player
soon after he joined,

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:14.930
and 2 years after our senior
players left, he was our ace pitcher.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:19.430
Well, being on the same team
together seemed pretty stupid,

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:23.890
so in high school, I started doing soccer.

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:28.970
--Since he's the kind of guy who can do anythin'.
--Why don't you guys get it? Are you dumb?

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.560
How mean! Tono, he's being mean to me!

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:36.140
He just doesn't understand that
people can feel frustrated.

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:49.470
But still,

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:52.310
he doesn't have a mean bone in his body.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:57.350
Yeah, I get what you're
saying about you and Ichiro.

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:59.970
You'd be lying if you said
you weren't frustrated,

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:06.770
but you also genuinely think,
"Wow, he's so cool!"

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:13.270
Haru may be a bit shy, but he really
understands how other people feel.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:14.470
What was that?

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:20.310
Right, Gen and I will be your spotters,
so let's practice some more!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.350
Yeah!

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.970
You okay?

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.350
Welp, I've gotta get to work.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.720
Later!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:39.680
Hey!

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:41.180
Gen!

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:42.810
I'm sorry.

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:46.020
You've spent so much time
helping me practice...

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.680
...and I just can't do it.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:48.970
Same here.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:51.310
And gym class is tomorrow...

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:52.930
Forgive me.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.640
Don't apologize!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.350
Gen's right!

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:00.720
Even if you can't do it tomorrow,
keep your spirits up!

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:06.180
Put on a cheerleader smile!
That's the soul of cheerleading!

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:08.930
So why don't we call it a day?

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:11.020
I've got to go to work, too.

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:14.850
Yeah. We'll make a fresh start
tomorrow morning.

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:17.770
We'll practice for just a little longer.

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:18.770
Right?

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:21.850
See ya.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:22.890
Later.

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:29.720
Okay, now look right between your hands!

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.720
Gain some momentum!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.680
Jump! Make a bridge!

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.520
Ton!

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:38.390
That was really dangerous.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.930
Give up before you hurt yourselves.

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:47.600
We're not giving up.

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:54.180
In gym class tomorrow, we'll show you
what we've been practicing.

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:55.520
You'll see!

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.390
Do what you want.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:02.180
Thanks for worrying about us!

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:04.930
Right, now I'll do it.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:06.520
Here I go!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:08.770
You can do it, Mizoguchi!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:10.310
Go for it!

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:18.850
Go, fight, win!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.640
Go, fight, win!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.680
Okay, one more time!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.770
Yes, jump!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.350
Keep trying!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:29.680
--Almost, almost!
--Fight for it!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:32.270
--You've got this!
--You're almost there!

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:40.890
Did I... do it?

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.600
--You did it!
--You really did it!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.220
Way to go, Mizoguchi!

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.970
Congratulations!

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:51.560
How wonderful it is to have
someone celebrate your efforts.

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:53.890
Don't be so dramatic.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:57.100
I've always been running alone.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:59.720
I was even a long-distance
runner on the track team.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:03.390
And I left everyone in the dust
with my good grades in high school.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:04.770
Huh?

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.810
But I didn't perform well under pressure,
ruined my health during the entrance exams,

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.140
and failed them twice.

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:14.430
Only then did I have nowhere to run.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:17.810
For some reason people would
snicker whenever I spoke,

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:20.720
and I always felt out of place.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:25.850
"We finite beings, who embody an infinite spirit,
are born to suffer both pain and joy,

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:32.600
and one might almost say the
best of us know joy through pain."

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.640
Dixit Ludwig van Beethoven.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:39.100
I want to know it, too.

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:43.470
I can do it... I hope.

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:45.180
Yeah!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.270
We will be Squirrel Kings together, Ton!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.390
What're y'all up to?

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:53.890
I finished work early today.

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:56.060
So it's only Ton left.

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:58.810
Let's get practicin'!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.850
I'm going to do it now!

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:01.850
Right-o!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:03.350
Go for it, Ton!

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.720
You can do it!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.720
Why are you crying, Mizoguchi?

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:34.470
Gross, Mizoguchi! You're such a crybaby!

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:40.680
He's not here.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:41.850
He's gone.

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:43.600
He ran away!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.680
Tokugawaaaaa!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:49.060
Maybe he just went to the bathroom.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.640
Ton...

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:59.970
Huh? Sho!

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:03.100
Why weren't you in gym class?

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.520
I wasn't feeling up to it.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:08.770
Some guys doing handsprings said
they wanted to show you something.

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:12.890
They were flipping around
in a corner the whole class.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.640
Aren't they still at it?

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.560
--Go for it!
--You can still do it!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:19.770
Go, go!

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:21.640
Right!

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:25.890
It's almost lunchtime.
I'd like to close up here...

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:28.640
I'm sorry. Just give us a bit longer!

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:42.060
We'll do it again!

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:43.890
Are you still up for it?

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:44.560
Yeah.

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.220
Me, too.

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.810
Okay! One more time!

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.600
Enough, already.

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:02.680
Doing handsprings like that
will definitely kill your wrists.

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:08.020
I'll at least teach you
how to do one properly.

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:10.720
Just spit it out and say
you're joinin' the team!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.390
Your cool guy demeanor
is really pissin' me off!

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:22.890
These are super-duper rare!

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:26.100
I mean, I just really like them.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:27.470
Really, really like them.

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:30.770
I'll give them to you to celebrate.

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:32.560
Don't worry, I have another set.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.560
And you're making me nervous.

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:37.720
You mean it?!

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:46.020
Okay, then let's celebrate Sho
joining the team by digging in!

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:48.350
Let's eat!

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:55.310
I have just one condition
for joining the team.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.970
W-What is it?

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:59.970
Do you want an even rarer set?

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:01.680
Not that.

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:06.930
I won't do any stunts.

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.930
The Seventh Squirrelurai

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:24.430
<i>Without even thinking, I shouted a reply</i>

00:22:24.430 --> 00:22:31.020
<i>The voice opening that new door</i>
<i>sounded like a tightly clenched fist</i>

00:22:31.020 --> 00:22:34.430
<i>Resounding with reassuring determination</i>

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:37.850
<i>I think if I let out</i>
<i>(I've been waiting for this)</i>

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:41.140
<i>All my pent-up energy</i>
<i>(I can change something)</i>

00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:47.720
<i>We've always been looking for</i>
<i>something this cool! Ain't that right?</i>

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:50.640
<i>Feeling insecure</i>
<i>(Oh my God!)</i>

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:53.930
<i>I fell into a funk</i>
<i>(Oh my pride!)</i>

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:56.020
<i>Send that old me</i>
<i>(Don't give in!)</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:57.680
<i>A solid cheer</i>
<i>(Go, go!)</i>

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:02.180
<i>Make encouraging motions</i>
<i>(Let's dance together!)</i>

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:05.560
<i>Yes! Fly high, fly dive, up and away!</i>

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:09.270
<i>Never hang your head and give up</i>
<i>(No!) </i>

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:12.600
<i>Break up, break out, break it to smithereens</i>
<i>(Yes!)</i>

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:15.890
<i>Smile together, break a sweat, show your guts!</i>
<i>(Guts!)</i>

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:22.560
<i>Strike a victory pose toward the blue sky</i>
<i>(Jump! Jump! High V!)</i>

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:25.720
<i>Win over everybody's hearts!</i>

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:29.100
<i>Go for that moment when</i>
<i>you meet a sparkling smile</i>

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:37.220
<i>Go, fight! Go, fight, win!</i>

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:43.560
Good night.

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:44.180
Oh?

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:45.770
Even in my dreams
I go nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.640
In the ocean and in the mountains
I go nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:23:47.640 --> 00:23:49.350
While counting sheep
I go nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:52.350
Together we all go nuts, nuts, nuts,
nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts, nuts!

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:53.770
So good!

00:23:53.770 --> 00:23:54.560
BBQ!

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:57.060
Don't you want to be in our commercial, too?

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.830
Apply for a chance to appear with Risujiro!

00:23:57.060 --> 00:23:58.850
Bases! Your elbows are too low!

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:00.100
--Lift them higher!
--Right!

00:24:00.100 --> 00:24:01.970
--Spotter, pay attention!
--Right!

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:03.270
Flyer, your posture is terrible!

00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:04.560
--Straighten up your arms!
--Right!

00:24:04.560 --> 00:24:06.470
--Get your rear in gear!
--Right!

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:10.840
Next Episode: What We Want To Break

00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:09.470
Next Episode: What We Want To Break.

00:24:09.470 --> 00:24:10.850
Go! Fight! Win!
